   ],
   "grammar": [
    {
     "title": "比……更……；最……",
     "points": [
      "单音节词加 -er / -est：tall → taller → tallest；以 e 结尾加 -r/-st：large → larger；重读闭音节双写：big → bigger；辅音 + y 变 i：easy → easier。",
      "多音节词用 more / most：expensive → more expensive → the most expensive。",
      "不规则：good / well → better → best；bad → worse → worst；many / much → more → most；little → less → least；far → farther/further。",
      "比较级 + than：Tokyo is bigger than Osaka.　最高级前加 the：the best restaurant in town。",
      "as + 原级 + as：同样……：She is as tall as her mother. 否定 not as ... as。"
     ],
     "examples": [
      [
       "This is the most interesting book I have ever read.",
       "这是我读过的最有趣的书。"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "special": [
    {
     "w": "more and more",
     "t": "固定搭配",
     "s": [
      [
       "",
       "越来越多"
      ]
     ],
     "x": [
      [
       "More and more people work from home.",
       "越来越多的人在家工作。"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "w": "as … as possible",
     "t": "句型",
     "s": [
      [
       "",
       "尽可能……"
      ]
     ],
     "x": [
